      "notes": [
        {
          "text": "The tariff structure applies from 15 October 2025; the fuel surcharge on pilotage of USD 0.210310 per GT applies from 1 October 2026, so the version starts on 1 October 2026. The July 2026 addendum only changes a capacity figure in the introduction.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-addendum-2026-07-15",
            "page": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "For ships up to 3,000 GT pilotage is a lump sum equal to the printed minimum; it is entered as a zero rate with that minimum.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-2025-10-15",
            "page": 26,
            "section": "IV.B"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Berth hire is printed per GT per hour without 'or part thereof', so exact hours are used; the minimum is per day and each started day counts."
        },
        {
          "text": "Two coastal container pilotage rates (INR 11.17 and INR 22.35) are printed with odd letter-spacing; they were checked against the PDF and corrected in the Markdown copy.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-2025-10-15",
            "page": 26
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Port dues and their 10% surcharge are payable in rupees to the Tamil Nadu Maritime Board for all ships, foreign-going ones included.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-2025-10-15",
            "page": 26
          }
        }
